  "title": "Memora: A Harmonic Memory Representation Balancing Abstraction and Specificity",
  "summary": "AI agents can't remember past conversations. They must constantly reload or retrieve context, which grows less efficient as tasks get longer and more complex. Memora solves this with a scalable memory system separating what’s stored from how it's retrieved.",
